ATP fixture for VMC-ATP-023, VMC-ATP-033, VMC-ATP-034. Test instrumentation, not part of the product.

An application plugin, added with VoidServer::add_plugin, that:
  - inserts the resource AtpResource("ATP plugin resource") and logs "ATP plugin applied";
  - logs "ATP event startup" from a Startup system that reads the resource;
  - registers /atpprobe, which replies "ATP resource: ATP plugin resource";
  - observes join, ready, quit, chat, move, rotate, break, place and use-item events and logs
    "ATP event <name> player=<name> ..." for each.
It changes no framework file.

Apply at the repository root:   git apply tools/atp/patches/<this file>
Remove it after the test:       git apply -R tools/atp/patches/<this file>

